++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++ DIRECTION TO RUN using ngrok +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++

0. Update CORS in main.py
   allow_origins = ["*"]

1. RUN BACKEND 
   uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000

2. START NGROK TUNNEL
   ngrok http 8000

3. Verify the Domain in Google Cloud
   Go to google search console and paste your ngrok url in URL Prefix (NOT DOMAIN) and verify
   copy HTML METADATA 
   Go to Google Cloud Console -> APIs & Services -> Domain Verification.
   Add your new ngrok URL (without the https://).
   Complete the Search Console HTML tag verification if prompted.  -> YOU CAN FIND IT IN GOOGLE SEARCH CONSOLE (same METADATA that you copied earlier)

4. Register the Watch Channel
   WEBHOOK_URL = "YOUR_NGROK_BASEURL/api/admin/sync-policies"

5. RUN register_webhook.py -> to create connection between google drive folder and backend which will trigger the docs updation in folder
   python register_webhook.py

6. Update the React Frontend Environment
   VITE_API_BASE_URL="YOUR_NGROK_BASEURL"

7. Start the React Frontend
   npm run dev


